WEBVTT

00:07.120 --> 00:10.440
Chu Meng call the eldest son.

00:16.640 --> 00:19.520
Father, why did you urgently summon me?

00:20.520 --> 00:21.920
Come.

00:23.600 --> 00:25.000
Come.

00:30.280 --> 00:32.000
My body.

00:32.880 --> 00:37.120
Is getting worse day by day Father, what are you saying?

00:37.720 --> 00:39.120
Do you remember.

00:40.080 --> 00:45.053
When I fought back to the capital the first time you called me father.

00:45.920 --> 00:47.587
What did I promise you?

00:51.280 --> 00:55.960
I said to make you the king of the entire realm.

01:07.080 --> 01:08.680
This, take it.

01:15.760 --> 01:17.360
Father, this.

01:21.400 --> 01:22.800
Rise.

01:24.960 --> 01:30.520
You've managed court affairs for many years I'll entrust Xuan Kingdom to you I'm at ease.

01:30.680 --> 01:36.080
Your mother can also rest in peace but.

01:37.400 --> 01:38.760
I have one thing.

01:39.480 --> 01:41.160
I need your promise.

01:43.400 --> 01:48.067
If Father commands Your son will obey Your second brother is impulsive.

01:48.880 --> 01:54.280
But he values family and state values loyalty and righteousness.

01:54.960 --> 01:58.853
Now in the army grand General Zu Yue is in command.

01:59.240 --> 02:04.280
The Second Prince is not your enemy he is your support, understand?

02:08.080 --> 02:09.480
In my lifetime.

02:10.680 --> 02:14.680
I've done many things that can only be kept in my heart.

02:16.400 --> 02:19.280
Loyal ministers and good generals, I've sacrificed.

02:21.280 --> 02:23.240
Brothers.

02:24.440 --> 02:26.440
I've also raised my sword against.

02:29.320 --> 02:32.720
Even though we drove out Wuzhao and recovered Great Xuan.

02:33.480 --> 02:38.000
Such things how can merits and faults cancel each other out?

02:38.680 --> 02:41.400
Father sheng'er.

02:45.800 --> 02:47.467
I want all of this.

02:48.240 --> 02:50.080
To end with me.

02:51.760 --> 02:53.160
Our Sikong family.

02:54.080 --> 02:56.640
Must not shed Sikong blood again.

03:04.160 --> 03:08.440
I want you to lead the people into a golden age.

03:08.920 --> 03:11.840
To be a perfect and wise ruler.

03:14.480 --> 03:15.880
Your son.

03:16.640 --> 03:18.760
Will not fail Father's trust.

03:31.440 --> 03:32.840
Rise.

03:37.400 --> 03:38.800
Good son.

